  "description": "Objective 3, Step 7. Full dev, both models, Vulkan. O3-S7a = O3-S6 + forced-answer recovery (a note that tools are finished; prose around a printed tool call kept; otherwise the printed call run once and the answer asked for once more). O3-S7 = O3-S7a + prompt v1.2 (search-now examples, answer from shown results, staff rules) + staff guard (an answer that offers staff gets a real call_staff). Then the 40 dev dialogues with O3-S7. Resumable. About 2-3 hours.",
